<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT -Cemex begun as buy, Apasco as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -Cemex begun as buy, Apasco as hold.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lazard Freres said on Thursday it began coverage of two Mexican cement companies, with a buy rating for Cemex and a hold on Apasco.</p>
<p>&quot;In our view, Cemex has attractive near-term growth potential internationally and is undervalued relative to its global competitors, while Apasco is less interesting due to its rich valuation and dependence on the Mexican cement market,&quot; analyst Bonnie Rosenberg said in a report.</p>
</text>
